  = note: an XPath location must select existing nodes: a declared variable `$name` or a path below it such as `$name/child` or `$name/@attribute`; `a.b` is one variable name that contains a dot, and `a[0]` is a predicate, not an index
  = help: write a `$`-rooted path to a declared `<data>` variable, such as `$count` or `$order/item/@qty`
